# Photographs dropped in here a folder at a time, one folder per page.
# They are full-size originals, around 205MB a set, and only the resized
# derivatives in public/farm belong in git. Without these lines a routine
# `git add -A` sweeps the lot into a commit, which is exactly what happened
# on 20 November 2026.
